WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.120
SQL injection matters because applications often enforce identity, access, data handling,

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.060
business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:15.600
Teams should evaluate this issue across user-facing features, APIs, administrative tools,

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.620
cloud services, and delivery pipelines.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:24.040
Command injection matters because applications often enforce identity, access,

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:28.100
data handling, business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:34.720
LDAP injection matters because applications often enforce identity, access, data handling,

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.740
business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:43.000
NoSQL injection matters because applications often enforce identity, access,

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:47.140
data handling, business workflows, and service integrations.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:53.200
Parameterized queries Input validation Output encoding Selected CIS Controls mappings for

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.580
this topic include Control 16 - Application Software Security;

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:05.480
16.2 - Establish secure coding practices; 16.13 - Conduct application penetration testing.
